<title>USA: First Pacific National to buy Wells branch.</title>
<headline>First Pacific National to buy Wells branch.</headline>
<dateline>ESCONDIDO, Calif 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific National Bank said it agreed to purchase Wells Fargo and Co's branch in Valley Center.</p>
<p>The sale includes deposit accounts and facilities of the branch.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
